

 Minutes of the FIGGY BAR RT Conference.
 Date: 10/25/90   Time: 22:48EDT

  The question of the night "What do you think of the changes in ForthNet ?
  Do you even care ?" This prompted a discussion of the recent (dramatic)
  changes in the connectivity of this support resource. Other items discussed
  include implementing strings in Forth, hardware prototyping mag tape 
  controllers, management reluctance to accept Forth.

Attendees:
[[Gary] GARY-S]
[[LEN] NMORGENSTERN]
[[bill] B.CLARK10]
[[Dave] OLORIN]
[[Robert] R.BERKEY]
[[Wil] W.BADEN1]

