<[Robert] R.BERKEY> Oh, I'm sure there are 68000 Forth's here, I just don't 
know much about them.
<[Gary] GARY-S> There are a couple specifically for mounting on C and a couple 
of native code 68K Forths in the library, plus a F83
<[Robert] R.BERKEY> F83 was first done on the 68K and Mitch Bradley also has a 
